  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong>  </span></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\">has released the <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong data-start=\"234\" data-end=\"244\">result</strong></span> for the Non Technical Popular Categories <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"276\">NTPC Graduate Level</strong> posts</span>. RRB has invited huge number of vacancies for NTPC Graduate Level post recruitment during the <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"604\">16 March 2026 to 27 March 2026</strong></span>. There were <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong data-start=\"389\" data-end=\"404\">5,810 posts</strong></span> were called for the hiring of RRB NTPC Graduate Level in various trades. <span style=\"color: #000000;\">The <strong data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"555\">CBT examination</strong> was held from <strong data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"604\">16 March 2026 to 27 March 2026</strong></span>. Candidates <span data-teams=\"true\">who appeared for this examination</span> can check their <strong>RRB NTPC CEN 06/2025 Graduate Level Result 2026</strong> from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Railway Recruitment Board (RRB)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">RRB NTPC Graduate Level CBT-I Result 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">RRB NTPC Graduate Level CEN 06/2025</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates (Tentative)&nbsp;</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>21 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>27 November 2025 (Extended)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>27 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction / Modified Form : <b>30 November 2025 to 09 December 2025</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Status : <b>20 January 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date CBT-I : <b>16-27 March 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam City Details : <strong>10 Days Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>12 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key Available : <strong>06 April 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">CBT-I Result : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>11 June 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC, EWS :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 250/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All Category Female :<strong>&nbsp;Rs. 250/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: #ffff00; color: #000000;\"><strong>Fee Refund (After Appearing in Stage I Exam)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC, EWS : <strong>Rs. 400/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH : <strong>Rs. 250/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All Category Female :<strong>&nbsp;Rs. 250/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RRB NTPC Graduate Level Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 January 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>33 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per RRB NTPC Graduate Level Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RRB NTPC Graduate Level 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 5810 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 44.9295%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.5584%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Category&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.512%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Posts</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 44.9295%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"5\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Non Technical Popular Categories NTPC Graduate Level Post</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.5584%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.512%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">2321</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.5584%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.512%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">602</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.5584%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">OBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.512%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">1508</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.5584%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.512%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">922</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.5584%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.512%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">457</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>RRB NTPC Graduate Level Online Form 2025 : Post Wise Vacancy Details</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><b>Post Name</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Chief Commercial-cum-Ticket Supervisor</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">161</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Station Master (SM)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">615</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Goods Train Manager</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">3416</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Junior Accounts Assistant Cum Typist</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">921</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Senior Clerk Cum Typist</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">628</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Traffic Assistant&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">59</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\"><strong>Check</strong>&nbsp;<strong>RRB Zone Wise Vacancy Details –&nbsp;<a style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/RRB-NTPC-Graduate-Level-CEN-No-06-2025-RRB_Post-Wise-Vacancy.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>RRB NTPC Graduate Level Recruitment 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates having Graduation degree&nbsp;in any Stream from any recognized university / college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Typing proficiency in English / Hindi on Computer is essential.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>RRB NTPC Graduate Level Online Form 2025 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">CBT Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Typing Test (If Applicable)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download RRB NTPC Graduate Level CBT-I Result 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must go to the&nbsp;<strong>Important Links</strong>&nbsp;section below</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates must click on the Result link.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After clicking on the link, the candidates will be redirected to a new page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page, candidates have to enter the following details:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Registration no.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Login ID</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Birth Date/Password</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Captcha Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates have to&nbsp; submit the details by clicking on the Login button.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After successful login, candidates will be able to download the Result.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Alternatively, the candidates can download the Result from the official website of RRB also.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" style=\"width: 100.27%;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Check Zone Wise RRB NTPC CEN 06/2025 Graduate Level Result 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Region Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Exam Result</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Cutoff</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><b>RRB Allahabad</b></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/5667af3a-bc5d-48e3-ad7d-daba6d806f0d.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Result</strong></a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/5667af3a-bc5d-48e3-ad7d-daba6d806f0d.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Cutoff</strong></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><b>RRB Patna</b></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.rrbpatna.gov.in/pdf/result_cutoff_cbt1_06_2025.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Result</strong></a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.rrbpatna.gov.in/pdf/result_cutoff_cbt1_06_2025.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Cutoff</strong></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><b>RRB Ahmedabad</b></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://rrbahmedabad.gov.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Result-CBT-1-CEN-06-2025-shortlisting-of-candidates-for-CBT-2.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Result</strong></a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://rrbahmedabad.gov.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Cut-off-CBT-1-CEN-06-202