=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/RRB-NTPC-Graduate-Level-CEN-No-06-2025-RRB_Post-Wise-Vacancy.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.rrbchennai.gov.in/downloads/Final-CEN-06-2025-21-10-2025-Publish.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">English</a> | <a href=\"https://www.rrbchennai.gov.in/downloads/Final-CEN-6-2025-%20Hindi-%2021-10-2025-Publish.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Hindi</a>&nbsp;</strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Download Exam Pattern / Syllabus</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Final-CEN-06-2025-21-10-2025-Publish-18-20.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Sarkari Exam Mobile App</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;\"><strong><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Join WhatsApp Channel</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Join Telegram Channel</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;\"><strong><a href=\"https://t.me/sarkariresulinfo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;\"><strong><a href=\"https://indianrailways.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Important Question</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. When will RRB NTPC Graduate Level CBT-I Result 2026 be released?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>The result has released on the official RRB website.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. How can I check the RRB NTPC Graduate Level CBT-I Result 2026?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>Visit the official RRB website, click on the NTPC Graduate Level Result link, and check your result using your roll number.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. In which format will the result be released?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.</strong>&nbsp;The result will be released in&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"494\">PDF format</strong>&nbsp;with the roll numbers of qualified candidates.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is the next step after qualifying the exam?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>Qualified candidates will be called for&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"676\">Physical Efficiency Test (PET)</strong>, document verification, and medical test.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. Will the cut-off marks be released with the result?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>Yes, the cut-off marks are usually released along with or after the result.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. Where will the RRB NTPC Graduate Level CBT-I Result 2026 be published?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>The result will be published on the official regional websites of the&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1033\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Railway Recruitment Board</span></span></strong>.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is RRB Official Website?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The Official Website of RRB is https://indianrailways.gov.in/</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
